<title>POLAND: Poland to offer PLN 400 mln of T-bills on Dec 19.</title>
<headline>Poland to offer PLN 400 mln of T-bills on Dec 19.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish treasury will offer 400 million zlotys of T-bills at a primary tender on December 19, 1996, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>It said it will offer 100 million zlotys of its 13-week T-bills, 100 million of 26-week bills and 200 million zlotys of the benchmark 52-week papers.</p>
<p>The value date for this auction will be on December 23, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
